{"seq":2,"slug":"money-precision-rounding","title":"整数分、Decimal 与币种舍入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/international-pricing-currency/fx-conversion/money-precision-rounding","wordCount":2765,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"整数分-decimal-与币种舍入\">整数分、Decimal 与币种舍入</h1><p>金额是计算机科学里最容易被写错的数据类型。这不是夸张：浮点数加法不满足结合律，<code>0.1 + 0.2</code> 不等于 <code>0.3</code>，而这些误差会以「对不上账的一分钱」的形式在几百万笔订单上累积成真实的财务差异。本篇给出金额表示的选择标准、币种最小单位的处理方式、以及「除不尽时余数给谁」的完整算法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-为什么不能用浮点数\">核心概念：为什么不能用浮点数</h2><p>IEEE 754 双精度浮点数用二进制表示小数，而 0.1 在二进制里是无限循环小数。它会被舍入到最接近的可表示值，这个值大约是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.1000000000000000055511151231257827</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.1000000000000000055511151231257827</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1000000000000000055511151231257827</span></span></span></span></span>（来源：Python 官方文档 <code>round()</code> 条目对该表示误差的说明，<a href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/library/functions.html#round）。当你把这样一个值乘以\">https://docs.python.org/3/library/functions.html#round）。当你把这样一个值乘以</a> 100 期望得到整数分时，可能得到 10.000000000000002，取整后是 10，看起来没问题；但在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.1</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.1 \\times 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 这类运算里，结果可能是 3.3000000000000003，而 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 再除以 3 之类的组合会让误差出现在完全意想不到的位置。</p>\n<p>真正致命的不是单次误差，而是<strong>误差的不可预测性</strong>：同样一轮计算，因为编译器优化、向量化、或者求值顺序不同，可能给出不同的结果。当价格计算跑在两台机器上而结果不一致时，库存扣减与价格校验会出现难以复现的分歧。</p>\n<p>正确的类型选择有两类，各有适用场景：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>表示</th>\n<th>实现</th>\n<th>精度</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n<th>不适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>整数最小单位</td>\n<td><code>BIGINT</code>（存 1999 表示 19.99）</td>\n<td>精确</td>\n<td>落库、订单金额、支付提交</td>\n<td>需要乘除的比例运算中间值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定点小数</td>\n<td><code>DECIMAL(p, s)</code> / Java <code>BigDecimal</code></td>\n<td>精确</td>\n<td>税率计算、分摊比例、汇率换算中间值</td>\n<td>需要高频比较/索引的列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>浮点</td>\n<td><code>FLOAT</code> / <code>DOUBLE</code></td>\n<td>不精确</td>\n<td>展示层的近似、统计抽样</td>\n<td>任何与钱相关的落库字段</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实践中最佳组合是：<strong>所有落库金额用 <code>BIGINT</code> 存最小单位整数，所有中间计算用定点小数类型，绝不让浮点数进入金额链路</strong>。这个组合的关键在于「最小单位整数」有一个明确的不变量：任何两个合法金额的加减仍是合法金额，不需要舍入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"币种的最小单位指数\">币种的最小单位指数</h2><p>「19.99 美元存成 1999」这个约定依赖一个前提：美元的最小单位是 1 分，也就是 2 位小数。但并非所有币种都是 2 位。ISO 4217 标准为每个币种定义了小数位（minor unit）指数，取值分布如下（依据 ISO 4217 现行表，活跃代码约 177 个；小数点后 3 位的 7 个与 4 位的 2 个可由 ISO 4217 现行码表直接核验，见 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_4217）：\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_4217）：</a></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指数</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>代表币种</th>\n<th>数量级</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>无小数</td>\n<td>JPY、KRW、VND、CLP、ISK、XOF、XAF、XPF、PYG、RWF、UGX、BIF、DJF、GNF、KMF、VUV</td>\n<td>16 个</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>1/100</td>\n<td>USD、EUR、CNY、GBP、BRL、INR（展示用）、多数币种</td>\n<td>绝大多数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>1/1000</td>\n<td>BHD、IQD、JOD、KWD、LYD、OMR、TND</td>\n<td>7 个</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>1/10000</td>\n<td>CLF、UYW（均为基金代码）</td>\n<td>2 个</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这里有几个必须注意的陷阱：</p>\n<p><strong>零小数币种不等于存储上不能有小数。</strong> 日元没有分，所以 5 日元就是最小单位 5。但一些支付服务商出于兼容性考虑，要求 JPY 的金额仍然按 2 位小数传递（即 5 日元传 <code>500</code>），并在文档里明确说明「不接受任何小数金额」。这意味着「内部存储的最小单位指数」与「喂给渠道的金额格式」是两回事——前者由币种定义，后者由渠道定义，渠道适配层必须把两者分开处理，具体见 <a href=\"../multicurrency-payment/acquire-in-local\">本地币种收单与渠道币种能力</a>。Stripe 的文档就明确指出 ISK 与 UGX 已迁移为无小数币种，但为向后兼容仍需用带 <code>00</code> 的 2 位形式表示（来源：Stripe 多币种文档「Special cases」，<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/currencies）。\">https://docs.stripe.com/currencies）。</a></p>\n<p><strong>有些币种的「最小单位」是 5 的倍数。</strong> 马达加斯加阿里亚里（MGA）与毛里塔尼亚乌吉亚（MRU）的最小单位是 1/5 而不是 1/100，ISO 表上标 2 但对这两者需要脚注说明（MGA 按 5 iraimbilanja = 1 ariary 细分，是当前流通的非十进制币种之一，见 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Malagasy_ariary）。如果系统里存了\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Malagasy_ariary）。如果系统里存了</a> 0.03 MGA 这种值，它在现实中不存在，无法支付。</p>\n<p><strong>指数 3 的币种制造了最隐蔽的 bug。</strong> 科威特第纳尔（KWD）最小单位是 1 费尔（fils）= 1/1000 第纳尔。如果系统的金额类型硬编码了「除以 100」，KWD 的金额会全部差 10 倍。这类 bug 在小币种上很难被发现，因为测试数据通常只用 USD。</p>\n<p><strong>指数可能变化。</strong> ISK 曾从 2 位变到 0 位，UGX 同理。币种元数据必须是数据（一张表）而不是常量，且变更时需要考虑历史数据——已经把金额按 2 位存进数据库的记录，在指数改成 0 之后如何解释？</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[金额请求: 19.99 USD] --&gt; B[查币种元数据]&#10;    B --&gt; C{minor_unit_exp}&#10;    C --&gt;|0| D[存储 19 ... 错误!]&#10;    C --&gt;|2| E[存储 1999]&#10;    C --&gt;|3| F[存储 19990]&#10;    E --&gt; G[领域类型 Money]&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H[渠道格式适配]&#10;    H --&gt;|渠道要求 2 位| I[1999]&#10;    H --&gt;|零小数渠道| J[19]\">graph TD\n    A[金额请求: 19.99 USD] --&gt; B[查币种元数据]\n    B --&gt; C{minor_unit_exp}\n    C --&gt;|0| D[存储 19 ... 错误!]\n    C --&gt;|2| E[存储 1999]\n    C --&gt;|3| F[存储 19990]\n    E --&gt; G[领域类型 Money]\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H[渠道格式适配]\n    H --&gt;|渠道要求 2 位| I[1999]\n    H --&gt;|零小数渠道| J[19]</pre><h2 id=\"money-类型的接口设计\">Money 类型的接口设计</h2><p>一个可靠的 <code>Money</code> 类型应该是一个<strong>金额与币种不可分离</strong>的值对象。下面这几条接口约束来自实践中的事故：</p>\n<p><strong>禁止隐式转换。</strong> 不允许 <code>Money + Double</code>、不允许 <code>Money(USD) == Money(EUR)</code> 直接比较。任何跨币种运算必须显式调用换算函数，而这个函数需要传入汇率——汇率是外部输入，不是 Money 的属性。</p>\n<p><strong>禁止无参数的 <code>multiply</code>。</strong> <code>Money × 1.08</code>（加税）的结果可能无法用最小单位精确表示，因此乘法必须指定舍入模式与目标币种。接口签名应该是 <code>multiply(factor, roundingMode)</code>，而不是 <code>multiply(factor)</code> 加一个默认舍入。</p>\n<p><strong>加减必须同币种。</strong> <code>Money(USD) + Money(USD)</code> 合法，<code>Money(USD) + Money(JPY)</code> 必须抛错，绝不能自动换算。这条约束的价值在于：它把「我忘了换算」这个错误变成编译期或运行早期的失败，而不是几周后对账时才发现的一个数字。</p>\n<p><strong>提供 <code>allocate(n)</code> 而非 <code>divide(n)</code>。</strong> 这是本篇最重要的接口决策，下一节展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分配算法-除不尽时余数给谁\">分配算法：除不尽时余数给谁</h2><p>把一笔金额平均分成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 份时，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A / n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 通常不是最小单位的整数倍。例如把 100 分钱分给 3 个人：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>33.33</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">33.33</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">33.33</span></span></span></span></span> 每人，余下 1 分。</p>\n<p>最差的做法是「每人 33 分，丢掉 1 分」——丢掉的钱会消失，长期累积成账目缺口。次差的是「每人 33 分，多的 1 分给最后一个人」——这在 n 很大时会造成明显的分配不公（最后一个人总是多拿）。正确的做法是<strong>最大余数法（largest remainder method）</strong>（该方法亦称 Hamilton 法，其定义即「先取整数部分、再按最大余数分配剩余单位」，见 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Largest_remainder_method）：\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Largest_remainder_method）：</a></p>\n<p>给定总额 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>（最小单位整数）与权重向量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_1, \\dots, w_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（和为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span>），先计算每份的理想值：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi>W</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_i = A \\cdot \\frac{w_i}{W}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.7936em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>取每份的整数部分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌊</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌋</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_i = \\lfloor x_i \\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌊</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">⌋</span></span></span></span></span>，余数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_i = x_i - f_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。此时已分配 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum f_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，剩余 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>−</mo><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R = A - \\sum f_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（必有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0 \\le R &lt; n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7804em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>）。把剩下的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 个最小单位按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 从大到小依次分配，每个份额最多加 1。若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 相同则按固定顺序（比如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 升序）打破平局，保证结果确定性。</p>\n<p>这个算法的性质正是会计需要的：<strong>分配结果之和精确等于原始总额</strong>，且每份与理想值的偏差不超过一个最小单位。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_{i=1}^{n} y_i = A, \\qquad |y_i - x_i| &lt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>工程实现上有一条性能提示：分配算法在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 较大时（比如按行分摊到 200 个订单行）需要一次排序，复杂度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n \\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。但这里有一个更简单的等价实现——因为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R &lt; n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>，且余数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的大小关系可以用 <code>(A * w_i) % W</code> 比较，不需要真的构造浮点数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∝</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_i \\propto (A \\cdot w_i) \\bmod W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>用整数取模比较余数，完全避开浮点数，且排序键是整型，性能与精度都更好。这是把「数学上清晰」的算法转成「工程上无浮点」的实现的典型手法。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[总额 A, 权重 w] --&gt; B[计算 A*w_i mod W]&#10;    B --&gt; C[f_i = 向下取整 A*w_i / W]&#10;    C --&gt; D[剩余 R = A - sum f_i]&#10;    D --&gt; E{按余数降序}&#10;    E --&gt; F[前 R 个份额各 +1]&#10;    F --&gt; G[校验 sum y_i == A]&#10;    G --&gt;|不等| H[抛出不变量违例]&#10;    G --&gt;|相等| I[返回分配结果]\">flowchart TD\n    A[总额 A, 权重 w] --&gt; B[计算 A*w_i mod W]\n    B --&gt; C[f_i = 向下取整 A*w_i / W]\n    C --&gt; D[剩余 R = A - sum f_i]\n    D --&gt; E{按余数降序}\n    E --&gt; F[前 R 个份额各 +1]\n    F --&gt; G[校验 sum y_i == A]\n    G --&gt;|不等| H[抛出不变量违例]\n    G --&gt;|相等| I[返回分配结果]</pre><p>最后一步的校验不能省。它是这个算法的运行时自证——如果因为溢出、权重含负数、或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 导致和不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>，必须立即失败而不是返回错误的分配结果。在生产环境里，每一次金额分配都做这个校验的开销可以忽略，而它拦截的是一类会静默污染账目的 bug。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分摊-折扣与税金的舍入顺序\">分摊、折扣与税金的舍入顺序</h2><p>分配算法在三个场景里反复出现：把订单总折扣分摊到各订单行、把整单税额分摊到各商品、把运费分摊到各包裹。这三个场景的顺序不同，结果也不同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>正确顺序</th>\n<th>为什么</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>折扣分摊</td>\n<td>先算整单折扣，再按行金额权重分摊</td>\n<td>分摊后各行折后价之和 = 整单折后价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>税额计算</td>\n<td>先算每行的税基，再汇总，最后算总额税</td>\n<td>各行税率可能不同，不能先汇总再算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运费分摊</td>\n<td>按重量或体积权重分摊，余数给权重最大者</td>\n<td>重量是运费的直接成本动因</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这三个场景的共同约束是：<strong>分摊后的明细之和必须精确等于整单金额</strong>。这条不变量比「每项都精确」更重要——因为对外展示的是整单金额，如果明细和与整单不一致，用户会看到一个自相矛盾的价格。所以实现上永远先确定整单总额，再用分配算法倒推出明细，而不是先算明细再求和。这三类分摊的输入都来自业务层：折扣来自促销规则、税基来自 <a href=\"../tax-checkout-ops/duty-tax-estimation\">关税/VAT 试算引擎</a> 的完税价格、运费来自履约系统——本篇只负责保证「给定的权重与总额，分配结果精确闭合」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>金额绝不能用浮点数落库或参与计算；用 <code>BIGINT</code> 存最小单位整数，用定点小数做中间运算。</li>\n<li>币种最小单位指数是数据而非常量（ISO 4217 中 0 位 16 个、3 位 7 个、4 位 2 个），且会变化；渠道的金额格式要求与币种指数是两回事。</li>\n<li><code>Money</code> 类型必须让金额与币种不可分离：禁止隐式换算、禁止跨币种比较、乘法必须带舍入模式。</li>\n<li>分配用最大余数法，结果之和精确等于总额；实现上用整数取模比较余数，全程无浮点。</li>\n<li>每次分配后校验「明细之和 == 整单金额」，不满足则立即失败。</li>\n<li>折扣、税、运费三类分摊的运算顺序不同，共同约束是明细之和必须等于整单金额，因此永远先定总额再倒推明细。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"整数分、Decimal 与币种舍入","id":"整数分-decimal-与币种舍入"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：为什么不能用浮点数","id":"核心概念-为什么不能用浮点数"},{"level":2,"text":"币种的最小单位指数","id":"币种的最小单位指数"},{"level":2,"text":"Money 类型的接口设计","id":"money-类型的接口设计"},{"level":2,"text":"分配算法：除不尽时余数给谁","id":"分配算法-除不尽时余数给谁"},{"level":2,"text":"分摊、折扣与税金的舍入顺序","id":"分摊-折扣与税金的舍入顺序"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"汇率源、刷新与缓存","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/international-pricing-currency/fx-conversion/fx-rate-source"},"next":{"title":"展示币种与结算币种分离","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/international-pricing-currency/fx-conversion/display-vs-settle-currency"}}